From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:09:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2030/3799] soh: rename func_808B5AF0 ->
 BgSpot16Bombstone_SetupWaitForObject

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: installs the wait action and hides the piece until the bombiwa object arrives
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c
index df518f68a..d34d44cfa 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot16_Bombstone/z_bg_spot16_bombstone.c
@@ -21,7 +21,8 @@ void func_808B5B58(BgSpot16Bombstone* this);
 void BgSpot16Bombstone_Idle(BgSpot16Bombstone* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_808B5950 [LLM:HIGH]
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_808B5934: restores the draw function and installs the idle action
 void BgSpot16Bombstone_SetupIdle(BgSpot16Bombstone* this);  // was func_808B5934 [LLM:HIGH]
-void func_808B5AF0(BgSpot16Bombstone* this);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_808B5AF0: installs the wait action and hides the piece until the bombiwa object arrives
+void BgSpot16Bombstone_SetupWaitForObject(BgSpot16Bombstone* this);  // was func_808B5AF0 [LLM:HIGH]
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_808B5A78: clears the timers, drops the draw function and installs the explosion action
 void BgSpot16Bombstone_SetupExplode(BgSpot16Bombstone* this);  // was func_808B5A78 [LLM:HIGH]
 
@@ -234,7 +235,7 @@ s32 BgSpot16Bombstone_InitDebris(BgSpot16Bombstone* this, PlayState* play) {
         return false;
     }
 
-    func_808B5AF0(this);
+    BgSpot16Bombstone_SetupWaitForObject(this);  // was func_808B5AF0 [LLM:HIGH]
     return true;
 }
 
@@ -490,7 +491,7 @@ void BgSpot16Bombstone_Explode(BgSpot16Bombstone* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_808B5AF0(BgSpot16Bombstone* this) {
+void BgSpot16Bombstone_SetupWaitForObject(BgSpot16Bombstone* this) {
     this->actionFunc = func_808B5B04;
     this->actor.draw = NULL;
 }
